    {
     "type": "discover",
     "topic": "Estilo indirecto completo",
     "intro": "Mira cómo cambian las palabras exactas al contarlas después.",
     "examples": [
      {
       "en": "\"I'm working.\" → She said she was working.",
       "es": "\"Estoy trabajando.\" → Dijo que estaba trabajando.",
       "mark": [
        "was working"
       ]
      },
      {
       "en": "\"I've finished.\" → He said he had finished.",
       "es": "\"Terminé.\" → Dijo que había terminado.",
       "mark": [
        "had finished"
       ]
      },
      {
       "en": "\"I'll call you tomorrow.\" → She said she would call me the next day.",
       "es": "\"Te llamo mañana.\" → Dijo que me llamaría al día siguiente.",
       "mark": [
        "would call",
        "the next day"
       ]
      },
      {
       "en": "\"Where do you live?\" → He asked me where I lived.",
       "es": "\"¿Dónde vives?\" → Me preguntó dónde vivía.",
       "mark": [
        "where I lived"
       ]
      },
      {
       "en": "\"Are you OK?\" → They asked if I was OK.",
       "es": "\"¿Estás bien?\" → Me preguntaron si estaba bien.",
       "mark": [
        "if I was"
       ]
      },
      {
       "en": "\"Wait here.\" → She told me to wait there.",
       "es": "\"Espera aquí.\" → Me dijo que esperara allí.",
       "mark": [
        "told me to wait"
       ]
      }
     ],
     "question": "En una pregunta indirecta (He asked me where I lived), el orden es…",
     "options": [
      "Como pregunta: where did I live",
      "Como afirmación: where I lived"
     ],
     "answer": 1,
     "rule": "En ESTILO INDIRECTO el verbo retrocede un tiempo (is → was, have done → had done, will → would) y cambian palabras de tiempo y lugar (tomorrow → the next day, here → there). Las preguntas indirectas usan orden de afirmación, sin do: He asked where I lived. Si no hay palabra interrogativa, usa if o whether. Órdenes: tell / ask + persona + to.",
     "ruleExamples": [
      {
       "en": "I wonder whether she'll come. Could you tell me what time the meeting starts?",
       "es": "Me pregunto si vendrá. ¿Podría decirme a qué hora empieza la reunión?"
      }
     ]
    },
